        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>英语语法笔记</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      background: #c8c5bd;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", Arial, sans-serif;\n      color: #202020;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 34px 13px 30px 37px;\n      background: #eeece6;\n      transform: rotate(-1.2deg);\n      transform-origin: center top;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .top-note {\n      width: 455px;\n      margin: 0 0 8px 15px;\n      padding: 5px 3px 4px;\n      background: #d2d4d5;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.72;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: .1px;\n    }\n    .entry {\n      position: relative;\n      margin: 0 0 3px 0;\n    }\n    .heading {\n      position: relative;\n      color: #a16183;\n      height: 24px;\n      padding-left: 14px;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 24px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #d8c2cc;\n    }\n    .heading .check {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: -22px;\n      top: -2px;\n      color: #c7829e;\n      font-family: cursive;\n      font-size: 29px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      transform: rotate(-11deg);\n    }\n    .heading .num {\n      margin-right: 8px;\n    }\n    .text {\n      margin-left: 14px;\n      padding: 5px 3px 4px;\n      background: #d0d2d3;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.72;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: .05px;\n    }\n    .entry.eight .text { min-height: 69px; }\n    .entry.nine .text { min-height: 46px; }\n    .entry.ten .text { min-height: 49px; }\n    .entry.eleven .text { min-height: 45px; }\n    .entry.twelve .text { min-height: 53px; }\n    .entry.thirteen .text { min-height: 69px; }\n    .entry.fourteen .text { min-height: 70px; }\n    .handwriting {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 35px;\n      top: -7px;\n      color: #333;\n      font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", cursive;\n      font-size: 25px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      transform: rotate(-8deg);\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"top-note\">\n      字母 o，加上 es 不用愁。“辅音字母＋y”来结局，变 y 为 i 是正规; es 后边<br>\n      紧跟随，study　　studies 看明白。\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"entry eight\">\n      <div class=\"heading\"><span class=\"check\">✓</span><span class=\"num\">8.</span>“ be going to ”</div>\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        be going to 表打算/准备/计划将要做、表可能/有必然、通过观察推；使<br>\n        用它，要注意，疑问形式 be 提前。否定句更简单，not 放在 be 后边；to<br>\n        之后，动原形，be 的形式看人称。\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry nine\">\n      <div class=\"heading\"><span class=\"check\">✓</span><span class=\"num\">9.</span>一般疑问句</div>\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        一般疑问句，变起来很容易，be 动词往前提，变否定也容易，be 后 not 加<br>\n        上去，针对一般疑问句，I 变 you 是常理\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry ten\">\n      <div class=\"heading\"><span class=\"check\">✓</span><span class=\"num\">10.</span>特殊疑问句</div>\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        特殊疑问句变起来有程序：第一，确定疑问词，第二，代替划线语，第三，<br>\n        将疑问词放句首，疑问词后加一般疑问句，语序倒置要牢记。\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry eleven\">\n      <div class=\"heading\"><span class=\"num\">11.</span>祈使句</div>\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        表命令和请求，通常主语被省，原形动词放句首 否定 don't 就可以 Let's 也<br>\n        是一句型，生活中常常用，祈使句不礼貌，使用分寸要把好\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry twelve\">\n      <div class=\"heading\"><span class=\"check\">✓</span><span class=\"num\">12.</span>过去式</div>\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        标准过去加 ed，少量不规则分别记，am,is 对 was，第二人称复数 are 变<br>\n        were,have,has 用 had. do 和 does 变 did.\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry thirteen\">\n      <div class=\"heading\">\n        <span class=\"check\">✓</span><span class=\"num\">13.</span>规则动词过去式构成\n        <span class=\"handwriting\">记住!!</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        过去式构成，一般词尾加 ed 加。如果词尾有 e，直接加 d 就可以。辅音<br>\n        字母+y 在词尾，变 y 为i加 ed。“一辅重闭”作尾巴，双写之后加 ed.\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry fourteen\">\n      <div class=\"heading\"><span class=\"check\">✓</span><span class=\"num\">14.</span>There be 句型</div>\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        There be 句型有规律，疑问否定都用 be，be 词可有不同形式，变疑问 be<br>\n        提前，变否定也容易，be 后 not 填上去，some 用于肯定句，否定疑问用<br>\n        any 换上去。\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
